  objective: "Mang m\xF3c qua h\u1EBBm, r\u1ED3i \u0111i ch\u1EADm qua d\xE3y \u1ED1ng
    x\u1EA3 h\u01A1i t\u1EDBi th\xF9ng th\u01B0 cu\u1ED1i (G13,6)."
  startLine: "Ca giao \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EC5. L\u1ECBch kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ch\u1ED7 cho
    th\u01B0 \u0111\u1EBFn mu\u1ED9n. H\xE3y quay l\u1EA1i v\u1EA1ch b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
  tierUpLines:
  - 
  - "\u0110\xE3 ghi nh\u1EADn. L\u1EA7n n\xE0y c\xE0ng m\xE1y s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EBFn
    s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n."
  ghostLine: 
  zones:
  - name: L1_Ton
    fromTime: 0
    toTime: 2.4
    hint: "T\u1EA5m t\xF4n r\u01A1i ch\u1EAFn l\xE0n g\u1EA7n \u1EDF G2: \u0111\u1ED5i
      sang l\xE0n xa (W), \u0111i qua, r\u1ED3i v\u1EC1 l\xE0n g\u1EA7n (S)."
  - name: L1_Moc
