      E \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u01B0\u1EE3t qua h\u1EBBm."
  - name: L1_Hoi
    fromTime: 10
    toTime: 14
    hint: "\u1ED0ng x\u1EA3 phun h\u01A1i \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc anh t\u1EDBi. \u0110i
      ch\u1EADm, nh\xECn h\u01A1i b\u1ED1c l\xEAn \u1EDF l\xE0n n\xE0o r\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ED5i
      sang l\xE0n kia (g\u1EA7n G11 \u2192 xa G12,2 \u2192 g\u1EA7n G13)."
