  twoGhostLine: 
  fragmentsCompleteLine: "Anh t\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EE9ng \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. T\xF4i
    c\xF2n nh\u1EDB c\u1EA3 l\u1EA7n \u0111\xF3."
  fragments:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0d469a68512fee42a0570d1d28b10ba, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ec1e7cb902db5a4a99b99da1b7f17ea, type: 2}
  solution: "1) T\u1EA5m t\xF4n r\u01A1i ch\u1EAFn l\xE0n g\u1EA7n \u1EDF G2: \u0111\u1ED5i
    sang l\xE0n xa (W), \u0111i qua, v\u1EC1 l\xE0n g\u1EA7n (S).\n2) \u0110i t\u1EDBi
    G3, b\u1EA5m E nh\u1EB7t m\xF3c tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi c\xE0ng m\xE1y ch\u1ED9p.\n3)
    \u0110i ti\u1EBFp t\u1EDBi c\u1ED9t c\xE1p G8, b\u1EA5m E \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u01B0\u1EE3t
    qua h\u1EBBm.\n4) T\u1EDBi th\xF9ng th\u01B0 cu\u1ED1i. (N\u1EBFu \u0111\u1EC3
    m\u1EA5t m\xF3c: l\xF9i t\u1EEB 2 gi\xE2y tr\u1EDF l\xEAn, NH\u1ECAP l\xEAn b\u1EADc
    1 \u2014 c\xE0ng t\u1EDBi s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n, v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF b\xE1o tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.)\n5)
    (v3.1) Sau th\xF9ng th\u01B0 gi\u1EEFa: d\xE3y \u1ED1ng x\u1EA3 h\u01A1i. \u1ED0ng
    \u1EDF G11 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n) \u2192 \u0111i l\xE0n xa; \u1ED1ng \u1EDF G12,2
    (l\xE0n xa) \u2192 v\u1EC1 l\xE0n g\u1EA7n; \u1ED1ng \u1EDF G13 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n)
    \u2192 sang l\xE0n xa; t\u1EDBi th\xF9ng th\u01B0 cu\u1ED1i G13,6.\nM\u1EA3nh
    nh\u1EDB: t\u1EDD ghi ch\xFA c\u0169 (G1,2 l\xE0n xa), m\xE1y thu t\xEDch t\u1EAFc
    (G12 l\xE0n g\u1EA7n)."
